{"id":"n16281-1-14","stage":2,"title":"끝없다 · 无尽","scene":"情境对话","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n16281-1-14-1","ko":"여행은 좋았어요?","zh":"这次旅行还愉快吗？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"여행은","meaning":"旅行，旅游","explanation":"여행：旅行，旅游；은：话题或对比助词。","readings":[{"term":"여행","audio":"/audio/b5d87b0a7b5d6b82f2a8.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"28026","senseId":"1","lemma":"여행","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"여행은","audio":"/audio/2553e8b91fd4286cb4b1.mp3"}},{"text":"좋았어요?","meaning":"好，高兴，愉快","explanation":"좋다：好，高兴，愉快；었：过去或完成，常与词干缩合。；어요：礼貌句末；可随语调表示陈述或询问。","readings":[{"term":"좋다","audio":"/audio/86d0464f1c6da40233cd.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"79033","senseId":"11","lemma":"좋다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"좋았어요","audio":"/audio/00fd50c82fea427bab50.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"b5d87b0a7b5d6b82","term":"여행","zh":"旅行，旅游","audio":"/audio/b5d87b0a7b5d6b82f2a8.mp3","entryId":"28026","definition":"离开家，去其他地区或国外游玩的行为。","pronunciation":["여행"]},{"id":"86d0464f1c6da402","term":"좋다","zh":"好，高兴，愉快","audio":"/audio/86d0464f1c6da40233cd.mp3","entryId":"79033","definition":"感情等很愉悦、很满足。","pronunciation":["조ː타"]}],"audio":"/audio/241236914fe8122e145d.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n16281-1-14-2","ko":"네. 끝없는 해변의 풍경이 아주 인상적이었어요.","zh":"嗯，一望无际的海景真的非常令人印象深刻。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"네.","meaning":"是，行","explanation":"네：是，行","readings":[{"term":"네","audio":"/audio/1c0ddfd0050938404c35.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"17294","senseId":"2","lemma":"네","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"네","audio":"/audio/1c0ddfd0050938404c35.mp3"}},{"text":"끝없는","meaning":"无尽，没完没了","explanation":"끝없다：无尽，没完没了；-는：将前面的动作或状态转为修饰名词的形式。","readings":[{"term":"끝없다","audio":"/audio/e63643d3be07abf0d364.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"16281","senseId":"1","lemma":"끝없다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"끝없는","audio":"/audio/e3fc3e22